positive dimensionless Hebbian gain reduced by the subtractive offset
$\rho$.  Absorbing the inessential $+1$ into the definition of $S$ this
is the familiar positive form $\kappa_{0}=-\rho/\phi\mu$, i.e. $c^{*}
=( \kappa_{0}S-1)/(S-1)$ with $\kappa_{0}\approx1+\rho/\phi\mu$ for the
